<title>USA: Tomorrow's Morning Inc completes IPO.</title>
<headline>Tomorrow's Morning Inc completes IPO.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tomorrow's Morning Inc, a children's newspaper publisher, on Friday said it completed its initial public offering of more than 1.16 million common shares and 900,000 common stock purchase warrants.</p>
<p>The offering, which began on February 10, raised more than $5.37 million in net proceeds for the company.</p>
